  "description": "A former MMA fighter, Lee Jung-woo, is now washed up and drowning in debt after being forced to retire due to an injury. Whenever the trauma from his injury resurfaces, he avoids reality by sleeping with random people, having one-night stands. Then, one day, he runs into Seung-jo, who is being chased while injured. After Seung-jo collapses unconscious, Jung-woo takes him home and ends up taking care of him.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/whitearea), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/the_white_zone)",
